{"id":"mwdnb42xjnpl8kppo5ubqxm9i","title":"王瑞庭先生传辑录","originalTitle":null,"summary":"王瑞庭先生，字鸿宜，号瑞庭，生于乾隆四十三年，殁于道光十一年，乐安县湖坪里人。他生前热心公益，多次赈济灾民，修整道路，资助族人赴考。其子云卿继承遗志，修建试馆，惠及族人。王瑞庭先生的善行受到后世敬仰，其祠堂至今保存完好。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=213646&do=blog&id=1561126"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T04:43:17.072Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T04:43:17.072Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":27,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}